OL,3,GNEWSAMan imported drugs for 'shamanic
OL,4,Arituals'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for importing
OL,7,FClass A drugs which he told police was
OL,8,Fmotivated by his interest in shamanic
OL,9,Frituals.
OL,11,FScott Kinta was caught after he
OL,12,Farranged to have several packages of a
OL,13,Fpowerful hallucinogenic delivered to
OL,14,Fhis home address, Nottinghamshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FThe force said Kinta, 36, of Yorke
OL,18,FStreet, Mansfield Woodhouse, had
OL,19,Fimported the packages from a "medicine
OL,20,Fman in Peru in return for future
OL,21,Ftraining in shamanic and tribal healing
OL,22,Fpractices".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
